                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "32abefbe-69a7-3ec6-b0fb-40f27b3399fe",
                        "entry_id": "21ac25db-6820-3ea8-99d1-de7bd4cb3fb0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to complete"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2b29d87-f670-43aa-8ff7-897979392b76",
                                "sense_id": "32abefbe-69a7-3ec6-b0fb-40f27b3399fe",
                                "text": "Своя́ прислу́га, осо́бое помеще́ние в ваго́не, бе́здна нену́жных бау́лов, чемода́нов и да́же сундуко́в, прибы́вших с ба́бушкой, вероя́тно, послужи́ли нача́лом прести́жа; а кре́сла, ре́зкий тон и го́лос ба́бушки, её эксцентри́ческие вопро́сы, де́лаемые с са́мым не стесня́ющимся и не те́рпящим никаки́х возраже́ний ви́дом, одни́м сло́вом, вся фигу́ра ба́бушки — пряма́я, ре́зкая, повели́тельная, — доверша́ли всео́бщее к ней благогове́ние.",
                                "translation": "Her retinue, her reserved compartment in the train, her pile of unnecessary trunks, portmanteaux, and strong-boxes, all helped to increase her prestige; while her wheeled chair, her sharp tone and voice, her eccentric questions (put with an air of the most overbearing and unbridled imperiousness), her whole figure—upright, rugged, and commanding as it was—completed the general awe in which she was held.",
                                "english": "Her retinue, her reserved compartment in the train, her pile of unnecessary trunks, portmanteaux, and strong-boxes, all helped to increase her prestige; while her wheeled chair, her sharp tone and voice, her eccentric questions (put with an air of the most overbearing and unbridled imperiousness), her whole figure—upright, rugged, and commanding as it was—completed the general awe in which she was held."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
